Description: Metabolomics analysis pipeline for postoperative primary graft dysfunction study.
    This project contains all code and analysis scripts for reproducing the results
    in Rust et al. 2026, Eur J Cardiothorac Surg.
    Reproducible computational environment available via Docker Hub 
    (jdpreston30/pgd-postop-metabolomics) and archived at Zenodo (pending; see manuscript for DOI).
URL: https://github.com/jdpreston30/PGD-postop-metabolomics, https://hub.docker.com/r/jdpreston30/pgd-postop-metabolomics
